    "caption": "🤖 ChatGPT Can Now Operate Chrome Tabs\n\nOpenAI updated its ChatGPT Chrome extension. In regular chat, the assistant can read open tabs and compare information from several sites, without manual copying. It can compare products by price, features, delivery times, and return terms.\n\nIn Work mode, ChatGPT can control tabs, click buttons, fill forms, send messages, download files, and group pages. It carries out tasks directly in the browser instead of only explaining them.\n\nThe updated sidebar brings Chat and Work modes into Chrome, along with chat history. The extension is available on all ChatGPT plans.\n\n📊@tech",
